{
 "page": "internal/spikes/c17-sheet-host/dist/index.html",
 "notes": [
  "Every key of `query` goes into the URL as-is (?mode=…&busy=…). Wait for window.__ready before the gesture.",
  "Coordinates are page CSS px. String coordinates name window.__geometry keys resolved after __ready: grab = sheet body under the handle, body = deep in the sheet (on it at medium and at large), handle = handle centre.",
  "kind swipe = one straight line at constant speed (from, to, durationS). kind drag = press pressS, move over durationS, hold releaseS, lift.",
  "`then` = a second touch started gapAfterLiftS after the first lifts (sweep the real gap around it; the probe log gives the real value).",
  "After each run: JSON.stringify(window.__trace), the probe event log, the mp4 and the per-frame sheet top y (sheet is #0a4bff; scan column window.__geometry.scan.x).",
  "Hybrid variants: H1 = snap on during touch (browser snaps if the page misses the release), H2 = snap off during touch (page reconciles at rest), H3 = H2 with the spring started from scrollTop as read (no momentum extrapolation), H4 = pure native (momentum + snap, no handoff). J = JS recognizer."
 ],
